            "author_name": "Jeff and Brittain Gonnels, Owners of G4 Fitness",
            "description": "Jeff and Brittain Gonnels opened G4 Fitness in Caddo Mills, TX and needed a single supplier to outfit their entire commercial gym. Our team equipped the facility across every major category: cardio, selectorized cable and multi-station machines, plate loaded strength, cages, racks and Smith machines, benches, free weights, storage, and functional training accessories. The result: a fully operational commercial gym running entirely on French Fitness equipment from day one.",
